<div class="remind-hint" data-i18n="settings.hashtags_hint">Tip: type #Name or #Category in an event's title or notes - even from Google or Apple Calendar on your phone. #Emma also shows it on Emma's calendar, #Sports gives it the Sports category, and you can use several.</div>
